# Memories Returning {2}{U}{U} sorcery: "Reveal the top five cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand. Then choose an opponent. They put one on
# the bottom of your library. Then you put one into your hand. Then they put one on the bottom of your library. Put the other into your hand."
# Bot1 pays {2}{U}{U} with Black Lotus and Mox Sapphire. The top five are Lightning Bolt, Memnite, Ornithopter, Mox Jet and Mox Ruby: Bot1 takes the Bolt;
# Bot2 buries Memnite, then (after Bot1 takes Mox Jet) Ornithopter, so Memnite lies above Ornithopter on the bottom; and the last card, Mox Ruby, comes
# to the hand. The two Islands that were below the five are now on top of the library.

